<div class="rich-text w-full"><p>Logistics businesses run on dozens of disconnected tools: one for GPS, one for payroll, a spreadsheet for trips, another for invoices. Next Fleet replaces them with a single, smart, and scalable platform that handles transportation, warehousing, and workforce operations from the first mile to the last.</p></div>
<div class="rich-text w-full"><p>Built with deep domain expertise, Next Fleet gives fleet owners, warehouse managers, and enterprise logistics providers real-time visibility and intelligent decision-making in one place.</p></div>
<div class="rich-text w-full"><figure><img src="{{ asset('media/images/profile/dashboard.jpg') }}" alt="The Next Fleet dashboard showing trips, tonnage and revenue by region" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption>The Next Fleet dashboard.</figcaption></figure></div>
<div class="rich-text w-full"><h2>Five core modules</h2></div>
<div class="rich-text w-full"><ul><li><strong>HR &amp; workforce management:</strong> driver and staff onboarding, attendance and payroll, KYC and license tracking, and a salary and ticketing system.</li><li><strong>Operations management:</strong> load and route planning, real-time GPS tracking, a hub-and-spoke route optimizer, and proof of delivery with trip reports.</li><li><strong>Accounting &amp; billing:</strong> automated invoicing, expense and outstanding tracking, freight billing and reconciliation, and tax and compliance management.</li><li><strong>Transport management (TMS):</strong> vehicle assignment and load management, dynamic route adjustment, delivery alerts with delay prediction, and trip-based analytics.</li><li><strong>Smart warehouse automation:</strong> inventory control and alerts, barcode and RFID tracking, dock and dispatch scheduling, and warehouse-to-vehicle coordination.</li></ul></div>
<div class="rich-text w-full"><h2>Key features</h2></div>
<div class="rich-text w-full"><p>Next Fleet brings a centralized dashboard, real-time GPS tracking with live ETAs, AI-powered route optimization, geofencing and zone mapping, and mobile apps for employees, customers, and drivers. Role-based access control, an SOS alert system, automated notifications and reports, multilingual support, and offline data sync for remote regions round out the platform.</p></div>
<div class="rich-text w-full"><h2>Secure, compliant, and ready to scale</h2></div>
<div class="rich-text w-full"><p>The platform is cloud-based and built to grow from one city to a hundred countries. It supports GDPR, GST, and e-invoicing requirements, and its workflows can be customized to each business. Our goal is simple: let logistics teams focus on growth, not on operational fire-fighting.</p></div>
